title: Bar_Start
---
Emuly: Yoo-Hooo! Howdy There! You look brand new around these parts, yer not from around here, are you?
  -> Pigeon: Came in on the last train
     Emuly:  I had a feeling! Fancy a drink?    
  
     
  ->Pigeon: I’ve lived here my whole life
     Emuly:  Oh…well anyways, a drink for your troubles?

Pigeon: Oh, I don’t got no beaks on me..

Emuly: why did you come into a bar with no beaks-

Emuly: That’s okay! This round’s on me, but I can’t spare much more

Emuly: The way most people get their fix around here are these bounties, you get one of these and I can fix you up real nice

Pigeon: I have to kill people for drinks?

Emuly: Beaks grow back, are you in or not?
 -> Pigeon: Why not   
  <<jump VinnyEnter>>
 -> Pigeon: Hell nah     
 <<jump VinnyEnter>>

===

title:VinnyEnter
position: 2,214
---
Vinny: WHERE THE HELL IS MY DRINK?

Bartender: Here you are, V, That’ll be 15 beaks

Vinny: You’re always ripping people off, just hand me the drink, I’m almost done with my bounty

Bartender: You know how it is V, no beaks, no drink

Vinny: You better be careful about who you’re talking to here, you know I can take you easier than my buddies outside

Pidgeon: Why are ya yelling so damn loud…coming in here threatening people…

Vinny: …

Vinny: Who the hell are you?

Pigeon: I’m Pigeon A. Holliday and I-

Vinny: I didn’t actually care, why are you talking to me right now

Pigeon: You’re threatening a lowly bartender right now, you’re out of line

Bartender: lowly?

Vinny: Oh thank goodness you were here then! I know exactly what you’re doing and you’re going to have to try harder than that.

Pigeon: what

Vinny: You think I’m so stupid, I can smell it on you

Vinny: Meet me outside, I’ll show you what happens when people cross me.

<<jump BountyIntro>>



